# GPU-014 (tests/headless graphics-report-desktop-down): Desktop fails after
# its first frame (a CUBIT_DESKTOP_FAULT=exit-once build) and nothing
# restarts it, as Desktop died at start on the T580 (BUG-009).
# graphics-report-check reads devmgr's renderer report meanwhile: it must
# still answer, with the GPU's entry and Desktop's last entry, stale.
(startup v1
  (start "logstore.svc" (test-console approve-declared))
  (start "clock.svc")
  (start "display.svc")
  (start "desktop.svc")
  (start "graphics-report-check.app")
)
